pssssst A TOUR OF THE HERD
pssssst Map, filter and fold, which here are stampede, cull and roundup.
pssssst Horses have moods: run with CLIPCLOP_CALM=1 to see what was supposed to happen.

pssssst 3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6
the Herd h says herd of cl1pcl1p and cl1p and cl1pcl0pcl0p and cl1p and cl1pcl0pcl1p and cl1pcl0pcl0pcl1p and cl1pcl0p and cl1pcl1pcl0p

pssssst how many, the first, the rest, and the third (horses are counted from cl1p)
headcount h
leader h
stragglers h
cut cl1pcl1p from h

pssssst stampede: square every horse
stampede (foal SingularHorse ridden by SingularHorse x says x * x) through h

pssssst cull: get rid of the odd ones
cull (foal Appaloosa ridden by SingularHorse x says (x % cl1pcl0p) == cl1p) from h

pssssst roundup: add them all up (31)
the SingularHorse add ridden by SingularHorse total and SingularHorse x says total + x
roundup add from cl0p through h

pssssst roundup: the biggest (9). No "less than" here either: see sort.dotclipclop.
the SingularHorse bigger ridden by SingularHorse a and SingularHorse b says \
  whinny (geld (a - b)) == (a - b) \
    snort neighneigh says a stomp \
    nicker says b
roundup bigger from leader h through stragglers h

pssssst roundup: turn the herd round, by putting each horse in front of the last
roundup (foal Herd ridden by Herd sofar and SingularHorse x says (herd of x) ++ sofar) from paddock through h

pssssst a herd can hold anything, including other herds
herd of "a string" and 'c' and neighneigh and (herd of cl1p and cl0p) and paddock
